c) Status of construction of water, sewer and drainage facilities and paving to serve land within the District, including the approval of any pay estimates and/or change orders, and acceptance by Harris County of streets for maintenance, including:
(i) Prairie Refuge Crossing — Water, Sanitary Sewer, Drainage & Paving — Millis Equipment, LLC; and
(ii) Traffic Signal Installation at Tuckerton Road and Copper Breaks Crossing — Larry Young Paving, Inc.;
d) Authorizing the design, advertisement, or award of construction contracts or concurrence in the award of contracts for the construction of recreational facilities within the District;
e) Status of construction of recreational facilities to serve land within the District, and the approval of any pay estimates and/or change orders, including:
(i) Parkland Village BLMZ Westgreen & Tuckerton Phase 2 Landscape Improvements — Allgreen Associates;
f) Acceptance of site and/or easement conveyances for facilities constructed or to be constructed for the District, and acceptance of facilities for operation and maintenance purposes, including:
(i) Conveyance of Facilities — Foundry Church 45' BLMZ Landscape Improvements;
(ii) Conveyance of Facilities — Parkland Village Lift Station No. 8;
(iii) Conveyance of Facilities - Starling Apartments BLMZ Landscape Improvements;
(iv) Conveyance of Facilities — Mason Road, Section 7— Water, Sanitary Sewer, Drainage and Paving;
